{*
	Valid Latte 2.11 that the plugin still gets wrong. Both are tracked in
	.ai/plans/04-zavorky-v-lexeru.md and both have a failing fixture in
	src/test/resources/data/coverage/edge-cases/.

	Expect visible damage below until those are fixed - this file is here so the
	damage is easy to look at, not because it is correct behaviour.
*}

{* An unbalanced brace inside a string literal ends the tag too early. *}
{= 'a } brace'}

{* A {php} body only survives one level of nested braces. *}
{php
	$total = 0;
	foreach ([1, 2] as $row) {
		if ($row > 1) {
			$total += $row;
		}
	}
}
